76
00:04:59,584 --> 00:05:02,204
(Legal) Bribe Category number one:

77
00:05:02,204 --> 00:05:03,964
Rich People (The Paper Collectors).

78
00:05:04,844 --> 00:05:06,564
Who you're (legally) bribing:

79
00:05:06,884 --> 00:05:12,284
Wealthy humans who have many papers and want even more papers, despite already

80
00:05:12,284 --> 00:05:15,444
having more papers than they could spend in several lifetimes.

81
00:05:16,324 --> 00:05:17,944
The (legal) bribe you offer:

82
00:05:18,124 --> 00:05:22,284
Modeled on World War Two War Bonds, except instead of four percent returns

83
00:05:22,284 --> 00:05:26,964
