84
00:05:26,964 --> 00:05:27,914
not-death.

85
00:05:28,604 --> 00:05:30,694
Like war bonds except backwards.

86
00:05:31,004 --> 00:05:32,244
Why they accept:

87
00:05:32,404 --> 00:05:36,284
Because rich humans can read a spreadsheet, and no spreadsheet in history

88
00:05:36,284 --> 00:05:40,184
