90
00:05:43,204 --> 00:05:44,644
Money-back guarantee:

91
00:05:44,664 --> 00:05:48,774
If the treaty fails, they get their papers back via assurance contracts.

92
00:05:49,144 --> 00:05:51,964
Funds are escrowed until milestones hit.

93
00:05:51,964 --> 00:05:53,764
Automatic refund if targets are missed.

94
00:05:54,824 --> 00:05:58,724
This is basically saying "if everyone dies from preventable diseases, you'll

95
00:05:58,724 --> 00:06:00,774
