96
00:06:01,644 --> 00:06:02,204
What happens:

97
00:06:02,964 --> 00:06:06,684
Defense contractors lose one percent of their revenue but discover a new

98
00:06:06,684 --> 00:06:11,104
twenty-seven point two billion dollars a year health spending market has

99
00:06:11,104 --> 00:06:12,744
