120
00:07:01,764 --> 00:07:02,264
Product:

121
00:07:02,404 --> 00:07:04,704
Things that make humans continue existing.

122
00:07:05,544 --> 00:07:06,664
Customer satisfaction:

123
00:07:07,024 --> 00:07:09,724
