131
00:07:27,464 --> 00:07:29,904
(Legal) Bribe Category number two:

132
00:07:31,324 --> 00:07:31,824
The True Believers (Early Adopters).

133
00:07:32,764 --> 00:07:34,304
Who you're (legally) bribing:

134
00:07:34,844 --> 00:07:38,604
Humans who believe in curing diseases AND want to get rich doing it.

135
00:07:39,264 --> 00:07:39,784
These exist.

136
