147
00:08:22,064 --> 00:08:23,264
What they fund:

148
00:08:23,324 --> 00:08:25,684
The Global Referendum marketing campaign.

149
00:08:26,144 --> 00:08:30,624
Getting two hundred and eighty million people to learn the referendum exists

150
00:08:30,624 --> 00:08:32,364
and vote on it. What they get:

151
00:08:32,364 --> 00:08:33,054
two hundred and seventy-two

152
