The same applies to politicians:

168
00:09:13,524 --> 00:09:17,704
the ten percent political incentive allocation scales with treaty size,

169
00:09:18,144 --> 00:09:22,504
so legislators who vote to expand are voting to expand their own campaign

170
00:09:22,504 --> 00:09:24,624
