177
00:09:39,224 --> 00:09:41,484
(Legal) Bribe Category Number Three:

178
00:09:41,684 --> 00:09:43,004
Regular People (Everyone Else).

179
00:09:44,024 --> 00:09:45,084
Who you're (legally) bribing:

180
