191
00:10:16,004 --> 00:10:20,104
Twenty-seven point two billion dollars per year flows to clinical trials.

192
00:10:20,584 --> 00:10:21,864
Diseases get cured faster.

193
00:10:22,364 --> 00:10:22,954
Your healthcare improves.

194
00:10:23,844 --> 00:10:28,404
Also, two hundred and eighty million humans now have a personal stake in

195
00:10:28,404 --> 00:10:32,484
