197
00:10:36,004 --> 00:10:36,744
Why this works:

198
00:10:37,404 --> 00:10:39,264
Humans love having opinions.

199
00:10:39,344 --> 00:10:40,644
Humans love getting paid.

200
00:10:41,004 --> 00:10:43,424
Humans (allegedly) love not dying.

201
00:10:43,944 --> 00:10:45,704
This combines all three.

202
00:10:45,804 --> 00:10:49,234
When three point five percent of the population has voted on something,

203
00:10:49,344 --> 00:10:51,884
politicians experience what you call "responsive

204
