218
00:11:27,844 --> 00:11:30,724
Two hundred and eighty million voters demanding the treaty.

219
00:11:31,244 --> 00:11:34,804
Plus cushy jobs after they leave office for politicians who vote yes:

220
00:11:35,744 --> 00:11:37,924
