222
00:11:42,224 --> 00:11:45,984
Insurance companies realize healthy people file fewer death claims.

223
00:11:46,844 --> 00:11:50,104
Suddenly their lobbyists become your lobbyists.

224
00:11:50,604 --> 00:11:51,104
It's beautiful.

225
00:11:51,504 --> 00:11:54,354
Like watching a dog realize the mailman has treats.

226
00:11:55,104 --> 00:11:55,604
The Package.

227
00:11:56,624 --> 00:11:57,944
Papers for campaigns:

228
00:11:58,544 --> 00:12:01,104
Massive Super PAC funding (legal bribery).

229
00:12:01,784 --> 00:12:03,504
Votes for staying employed:

230
