Referendum voters who will vote for treaty supporters.

231
00:12:06,704 --> 00:12:07,864
Post-office rewards:

232
00:12:08,264 --> 00:12:11,764
Fellowships, board seats, and speaking circuits for politicians who vote

233
00:12:11,764 --> 00:12:12,264
