234
00:12:12,924 --> 00:12:15,044
Power to reward friends:

235
00:12:15,244 --> 00:12:19,464
Direct a portion of the one percent Treaty Fund's twenty-seven point two

236
00:12:19,484 --> 00:12:24,324
