248
00:12:55,584 --> 00:12:56,184
What happens:

249
00:12:56,744 --> 00:13:00,404
Politicians discover they've always been passionate about curing diseases.

250
00:13:01,024 --> 00:13:05,064
This sudden passion perfectly coincides with receiving papers and votes.

251
00:13:05,884 --> 00:13:08,244
On your planet, that's called "representative democracy.".

252
00:13:09,704 --> 00:13:10,564
The Success Spiral.

253
00:13:11,624 --> 00:13:13,804
Each category of bribe creates the next.

254
00:13:14,604 --> 00:13:16,424
Rich people fund the referendum.

255
